      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Exif does not exist because of the png file specification.\nhttp://www.libpng.org/pub/png/spec/\nhttps://www.loc.gov/preservation/digital/formats/fdd/fdd000146.shtml#specs\n\nTherefore, we suggest adding data with png additional chunk types.\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/PNG-Chunks.html#C.Additional-chunk-types",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
